    "title": {
      "en": "New Dungeon Set Transforms Players into an Ogre in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "El nuevo conjunto de mazmorras transforma a los jugadores en ogros en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New Dungeon Set Transforms Players into an Ogre in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "El nuevo conjunto de mazmorras convierte a los jugadores en ogros en WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6af8ee9a8695d2.29663793\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Players have discovered an additional bonus to equipping all of the new <a data-entity=\"item-set\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item-set=2135/kroldok-battlegear\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Krol'dok Battlegear</span></a> armor from <a data-entity=\"zone\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=16842/kroldok-stronghold\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Krol'dok Stronghold</span></a> in Forever: Turning the player into an Ogre!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"reddit-markup exclude-units\"><div class=\"reddit-markup-container\" style=\"width: 740px; max-width: 100%;\"><blockquote class=\"reddit-card\" data-embed-theme=\"dark\"><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wowforever/comments/1xtsa35/getting_max_stacks_on_the_kroldok_set_turns_you/\">Visit Reddit</a></blockquote></div></div></div><br><br>One of the new dungeons in WoW: Forever, the Krol'dok Stronghold, has a new set of gear for Protection Warriors and Paladins with the <a data-entity=\"item-set\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item-set=2135/kroldok-battlegear\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Krol'dok Battlegear</span></a>. Some pieces, such as the <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=287014/kroldok-warplate-pauldrons\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Krol'dok Warplate Pauldrons\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_22.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Krol'dok Warplate Pauldrons</span></a>, are BoE, while others like the <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=275006/kroldok-warplate-helmet\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Krol'dok Warplate Helmet\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_20.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Krol'dok Warplate Helmet</span></a> are BoP drops from bosses within the dungeon. When players acquire all 5 pieces, not only do they benefit from all the set bonuses, but they also transform into an Ogre after reaching the max stacks from the set bonus!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1308400.png\" id=\"1308400\"><img width=\"600\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1308400.png?maxWidth=600\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Krol'dok Battlegear Set WoW Forever\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.29644 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>Blizzard has not only added new dungeon sets to Forever dungeons, such as <a data-entity=\"item-set\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item-set=2133/rotmenders-raiment\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Rotmender's Raiment</span></a> from Ruins of Lordaeron or <a data-entity=\"item-set\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item-set=2134/violet-sorcerers-vestments\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Violet Sorcerer's Vestments</span></a> from the City of Dalaran, but has also updated Classic dungeon sets such as the <a data-entity=\"item-set\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item-set=162/embrace-of-the-viper\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Embrace of the Viper</span></a> from Wailing Caverns. Leveling dungeon sets look to be more powerful and rewarding than they were in Classic WoW, and have been a very popular feature in WoW: Forever.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Players have discovered an additional bonus to equipping all of the new <a href=\"/forever/item-set=2135/kroldok-battlegear\">Krol'dok Battlegear</a> armor from <a href=\"/forever/zone=16842/kroldok-stronghold\">Krol'dok Stronghold</a> in Forever: Turning the player into an Ogre!<br /><br />One of the new dungeons in WoW: Forever, the Krol'dok Stronghold, has a new set of gear for Protection Warriors and Paladins with the <a href=\"/forever/item-set=2135/kroldok-battlegear\">Krol'dok Battlegear</a>. Some pieces, such as the <a href=\"/forever/item=287014/kroldok-warplate-pauldrons\">Krol'dok Warplate Pauldrons</a>, are BoE, while others like the <a href=\"/forever/item=275006/kroldok-warplate-helmet\">Krol'dok Warplate Helmet</a> are BoP drops from bosses within the dungeon. When players acquire all 5 pieces, not only do they benefit from all the set bonuses, but they also transform into an Ogre after reaching the max stacks from the set bonus!<br /><br />Blizzard has not only added new dungeon sets to Forever dungeons, such as <a href=\"/forever/item-set=2133/rotmenders-raiment\">Rotmender's Raiment</a> from Ruins of Lordaeron or <a href=\"/forever/item-set=2134/violet-sorcerers-vestments\">Violet Sorcerer's Vestments</a> from the City of Dalaran, but has also updated Classic dungeon sets such as the <a href=\"/forever/item-set=162/embrace-of-the-viper\">Embrace of the Viper</a> from Wailing Caverns. Leveling dungeon sets look to be more powerful and rewarding than they were in Classic WoW, and have been a very popular feature in WoW: Forever.</noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56121-new-dungeon-set-transforms-players-into-an-ogre-in-wow-forever.jpg",
