    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Refunding Gold for Players Who Purchased Skills During Monday Server Issues",
      "es": "Blizzard devuelve el oro a los jugadores que compraron habilidades durante los problemas con los servidores del lunes"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Refunding Gold for Players Who Purchased Skills During Monday Server Issues...",
      "es": "Blizzard devuelve el oro a los jugadores que compraron habilidades durante los problemas con los servidores del lunes..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6af8ef3a9aada7.67143199\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard is refunding gold to players who purchased skills during the server issues on Monday.<br><br>Earlier this week, Blizzard was forced to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/blizzard-taking-down-wow-forever-servers-shortly-383815\" data-contiguous=\"true\">take down the servers</a> due to issues. During this time, players lost some purchases during this time including some skills and <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/blizzard-addressing-missing-shaman-totems-due-to-mondays-server-issue-in-wow-383833\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Shaman Totems</a>. They seem to be working on resolving the issues.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2415068/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">With in-game mail that has now gone out to all affected players, we have refunded the cost of skill purchases that were made on Monday, November 9 between 1:17 p.m. PST and 2:17 p.m. PST (8:17-9:17 a.m. on November 10 AEDT) when the WoW: Forever servers experienced issues that caused some players to lose training they purchased.<br><br>If you were affected by this issue during that timeframe, check your in-game mail for gold equaling the cost of training that you purchased and lost.<br><br>Thank you very much for your patience and understanding.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard is refunding gold to players who purchased skills during the server issues on Monday.<br /><br />Earlier this week, Blizzard was forced to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/blizzard-taking-down-wow-forever-servers-shortly-383815\">take down the servers</a> due to issues. During this time, players lost some purchases during this time including some skills and <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/blizzard-addressing-missing-shaman-totems-due-to-mondays-server-issue-in-wow-383833\">Shaman Totems</a>. They seem to be working on resolving the issues. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">With in-game mail that has now gone out to all affected players, we have refunded the cost of skill purchases that were made on Monday, November 9 between 1:17 p.m. PST and 2:17 p.m. PST (8:17-9:17 a.m. on November 10 AEDT) when the WoW: Forever servers experienced issues that caused some players to lose training they purchased.<br /><br />If you were affected by this issue during that timeframe, check your in-game mail for gold equaling the cost of training that you purchased and lost.<br /><br />Thank you very much for your patience and understanding.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
